              "id": "tap_atelier_r_html",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"tap-atelier-r\">\n  <span class=\"tap-eyebrow\">— Our story · since 2014</span>\n  <h2 class=\"tap-section-title\">A workshop for instruments<br>that <em>don't fit</em> a category.</h2>\n  <p class=\"tap-lead\">Tapadum started as a duo of Italian musicians chasing a single Turkish oud across three Istanbul workshops. Eleven years later, our atelier in Brisighella is the home address for 26 master luthiers across the Mediterranean — and the shipping desk for nearly 2,500 hand-tuned instruments delivered worldwide.</p>\n  <ul class=\"tap-bullets\">\n    <li><span>01</span><div><strong>Direct from masters.</strong>No middlemen. Each instrument is signed by the luthier who made it.</div></li>\n    <li><span>02</span><div><strong>Tuned before dispatch.</strong>Every saz, oud and santur is set up and intonated by Yildirim's team in our atelier.</div></li>\n    <li><span>03</span><div><strong>Worldwide insured shipping.</strong>DHL Express in custom-built crates · 3–7 working days.</div></li>\n    <li><span>04</span><div><strong>Lifetime support.</strong>Free maintenance for two years · paid service forever after.</div></li>\n  </ul>\n  <a href=\"/about\" class=\"tap-btn-primary\">Read the full story →</a>\n</div>\n<style>\n.tap-atelier-r{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px}\n.tap-bullets{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:8px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n.tap-bullets li{display:flex;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #E8DFC8}\n.tap-bullets li:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid #E8DFC8}\n.tap-bullets span{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:24px;color:#9A7B3A;font-weight:500;flex-shrink:0;width:36px}\n.tap-bullets div{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#3a342c}\n.tap-bullets strong{display:block;color:#1A1612;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px}\n</style>"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
