              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"tap-section-head\"><div><span class=\"tap-eyebrow\">— Listen before you buy</span><h2 class=\"tap-section-title\">Every instrument, played<br>in our atelier.</h2></div><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@tapadum\" class=\"tap-btn-link\">YouTube channel →</a></div>\n<div class=\"tap-yt-grid\">\n  <a class=\"tap-yt\" href=\"https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ\"><div class=\"tap-yt-thumb\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3d2f1f,#7a5a2c)\"><span class=\"tap-yt-play\">▶</span><span class=\"tap-yt-time\">3:42</span></div><div class=\"tap-yt-meta\"><h4>Sultan Turkish Oud — solo taksim in Hicaz</h4><span>Yildirim Palabiyik · 14k views</span></div></a>\n  <a class=\"tap-yt\" href=\"https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ\"><div class=\"tap-yt-thumb\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2a3d3a,#7aa494)\"><span class=\"tap-yt-play\">▶</span><span class=\"tap-yt-time\">5:18</span></div><div class=\"tap-yt-meta\"><h4>Tapadum Pro 12 — handpan in D Hicaz</h4><span>In-house atelier · 28k views</span></div></a>\n  <a class=\"tap-yt\" href=\"https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ\"><div class=\"tap-yt-thumb\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a3a2a,#c89a5a)\"><span class=\"tap-yt-play\">▶</span><span class=\"tap-yt-time\">2:54</span></div><div class=\"tap-yt-meta\"><h4>Persian Setar by Hamid — Mahour mode</h4><span>Hamid · 9.2k views</span></div></a>\n  <a class=\"tap-yt\" href=\"https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ\"><div class=\"tap-yt-thumb\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6a3a,#d4b97a)\"><span class=\"tap-yt-play\">▶</span><span class=\"tap-yt-time\">4:08</span></div><div class=\"tap-yt-meta\"><h4>Master Ney — Feramis Aktas plays Saba</h4><span>Feramis Aktas · 11k views</span></div></a>\n</div>\n<style>\n.tap-yt-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}\n.tap-yt{background:#fff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;color:#1A1612;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid #E8DFC8;transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}\n.tap-yt:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 18px 36px -16px rgba(60,40,0,.25)}\n.tap-yt-thumb{aspect-ratio:16/9;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.tap-yt-play{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);color:#1A1612;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;padding-left:4px;transition:transform .25s}\n.tap-yt:hover .tap-yt-play{transform:scale(1.12);background:#D4AF37;color:#1A1612}\n.tap-yt-time{position:absolute;bottom:10px;right:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.75);color:#fff;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}\n.tap-yt-meta{padding:16px 18px 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\n.tap-yt-meta h4{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:17px;color:#1A1612;margin:0;line-height:1.3;text-wrap:pretty}\n.tap-yt-meta span{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8b7f6a;text-transform:uppercase}\n@media(max-width:1024px){.tap-yt-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}\n@media(max-width:600px){.tap-yt-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n</style>"
