              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"tap-section-head\"><div><span class=\"tap-eyebrow\">— Long reads from the atelier</span><h2 class=\"tap-section-title\">From the journal.</h2></div><a href=\"/journal\" class=\"tap-btn-link\">All posts →</a></div>\n<div class=\"tap-journal-grid\">\n  <a class=\"tap-jnl tap-jnl-big\" href=\"/blog/the-voice-of-the-kemence\"><div class=\"tap-jnl-img\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a3a2a,#c89a5a)\"></div><div class=\"tap-jnl-meta\"><span class=\"eb\">Field notes · 8 min read</span><h3>The voice of the kemence — three days with master Mehmet on the Black Sea coast.</h3><span class=\"date\">Oct 12, 2025</span></div></a>\n  <a class=\"tap-jnl\" href=\"/blog/healing-effects-of-the-ney\"><div class=\"tap-jnl-img\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2a3d3a,#7aa494)\"></div><div class=\"tap-jnl-meta\"><span class=\"eb\">Long read · 12 min</span><h3>Healing effects of the ney in Sufi music.</h3><span class=\"date\">Sep 28, 2025</span></div></a>\n  <a class=\"tap-jnl\" href=\"/blog/how-an-oud-is-built\"><div class=\"tap-jnl-img\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3d2f1f,#7a5a2c)\"></div><div class=\"tap-jnl-meta\"><span class=\"eb\">Workshop · 6 min</span><h3>How an oud is built — 14 days with Feramis Aktas in Istanbul.</h3><span class=\"date\">Sep 14, 2025</span></div></a>\n</div>\n<style>\n.tap-journal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:24px}\n.tap-jnl{text-decoration:none;color:#1A1612;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;transition:transform .3s}\n.tap-jnl:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}\n.tap-jnl-img{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:8px}\n.tap-jnl-big .tap-jnl-img{aspect-ratio:16/10}\n.tap-jnl-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\n.tap-jnl .eb{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9A7B3A;font-weight:600}\n.tap-jnl h3{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:22px;color:#1A1612